# .graphifyignore — what the graphify knowledge graph leaves out (gitignore syntax).
#
# This file REPLACES .gitignore for graphify: graphify reads .gitignore only where
# no .graphifyignore exists. Keep every .gitignore entry that could match a file
# graphify reads mirrored here. The graph is built from the main checkout's
# working tree, untracked local files included.
#
# The graph holds what was written on purpose: generated, downloaded and
# per-machine files stay out. graphify reads .tf, .tfvars, .hcl, .json and .sh as
# code, so lock files and provider caches would otherwise become nodes.
# (graphify already skips .terraform/, .venv/, __pycache__/, .idea/, tool caches,
# graphify-out/, .claude/worktrees/ and poetry.lock; they are listed anyway.)

# Mirrored from .gitignore
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.idea
tmp/
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/settings.local.json
__pycache__/
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
graphify-out/

# Graph-only: tracked, but generated or pinned
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
poetry.lock
